sequenceDiagram
  participant Zoom as Zoom Webinars
  participant API as Spring webhook API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL inbox/outbox
  participant Q as SQS
  participant W as Worker
  participant Reports as Zoom participant reports
  Zoom->>API: Signed participant join/leave webhook
  API->>API: Validate signature + timestamp + payload
  API->>DB: Transaction: unique receipt + outbox event
  DB-->>API: Commit durable record
  API-->>Zoom: 2xx acknowledgement
  DB->>Q: Outbox relay publishes at least once
  Q->>W: Delivery / duplicates possible
  W->>DB: Idempotent upsert provisional attendance evidence
  W-->>Q: Ack after commit
  Zoom->>API: Webinar ended
  API->>DB: Reconciliation job receipt
  Q->>W: Run report reconciliation
  W->>Reports: Fetch participants for specific occurrence
  Reports-->>W: Paginated report
  W->>DB: Merge intervals, flag mismatches, finalize or review
  Note over W,DB: Never interpret missing event as proven absence
